{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"RLSA-2026:99052","published":"2026-11-13T06:01:39.166938Z","modified":"2026-11-13T06:30:09.462323752Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-105544","CVE-2026-109475","CVE-2026-109476","CVE-2026-109478","CVE-2026-114146","CVE-2026-114147","CVE-2026-114149"],"summary":"Important: .NET 8.0 security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":".NET is a fast, lightweight and modular platform for creating cross platform applications that work on Linux, macOS and Windows.  It particularly focuses on creating console applications, web applications and micro-services.  .NET contains a runtime conforming to .NET Standards a set of framework libraries, an SDK containing compilers and a 'dotnet' application to drive everything.\n\nSDK version: 8.0.134\nRuntime version: 8.0.34\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* dotnet8.0: ASP.NET Core Denial of Service Vulnerability (CVE-2026-109478)\n\n* dotnet8.0: dotnet11.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet10.0: ASP.NET Core Information Disclosure Vulnerability (CVE-2026-109476)\n\n* dotnet11.0: dotnet10.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet8.0: .NET Elevation of Privilege Vulnerability (CVE-2026-105544)\n\n* dotnet8.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet11.0: dotnet10.0: .NET Denial of Service Vulnerability (CVE-2026-109475)\n\n* dotnet9.0: dotnet11.0: dotnet10.0: dotnet8.0: dotnet: ASP.NET Core Elevation of Privilege Vulnerability (CVE-2026-114146)\n\n* dotnet11.0: dotnet8.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet10.0: ASP.NET Core Denial of Service Vulnerability (CVE-2026-114147)\n\n* dotnet11.0: dotnet8.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet10.0: ASP.NET Core Denial of Service Vulnerability (CVE-2026-114149)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Update .NET 8.0 to SDK 8.0.134 and Runtime 8.0.34 (JIRA:Rocky Linux-302533)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"aspnetcore-runtime-8.0","ecosystem":"Rocky Linux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/rocky-l